<title>USA: Stage II Apparel Corp cuts Q4 loss.</title>
<headline>Stage II Apparel Corp cuts Q4 loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			  For the Year Ended  For the Quarter Ended</p>
<p>			     12/31/96  12/31/95  12/31/96  12/31/95</p>
<p> Net sales		  $33,428   $60,177    $8,901   $13,542</p>
<p>Net loss from continuing</p>
<p>  operations		(5,159)   (2,578)   (1,305)   (1,820)</p>
<p>Loss from discontinued</p>
<p>  operations		(1,803)     (684)     (681)     (487)</p>
<p> Net loss		  ( 6,962)  ( 3,262)  ( 1,986)  ( 2,307)</p>
<p>Net loss per common share</p>
<p>				( 1.66)   ( 0.78)   ( 0.47)   ( 0.55)</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>  shares outstanding	4,196     4,195     4,196     4,196</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 year includes charges of $2.3 million for operating and disposal losses frm Canadian operations and impairment charges against a former officer's prepaid salary.</p>
<p>1995 year includes $684,000 of losses from Canadian operations.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
